.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH terminal-of-tinsel-list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
terminal\-of\-tinsel\-list \- List every creature, grouped by pack
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBterminal\-of\-tinsel list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-pack\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every creature, grouped by pack
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the command\*(Aqs data as JSON instead of drawing it (errors become a JSON object on stderr)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Plain output: no colour, no emoji, ASCII borders (also set by NO_COLOR, or by piping)
.TP
\fB\-\-pack\fR \fI<PACK>\fR
Only use creatures from these packs, e.g. \-\-pack nordic,dickens
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
